## Narrative

[23:33] Session start.

[18:18] Sprint declared on spec 5 (telemetry v1): doc 6, 5 units, DEV1/DEV2 build, REV1 reviews. Interview: devs=claude/fable, reviewers=codex/gpt-5.6-sol (FnB confirmed). Booting DEV1 on unit 1.
[18:38] Unit 1 pr-open then in-review same hour: PR #100 green 6/6, 25 new tests. Ratified all 5 of DEV1''s ambiguity calls pre-merge; logged on board. Booting REV1 for review.
[18:48] REV1 review on #100: 1 Major (SC-016 prefs fail-open vs spec fail-closed) + 5 Medium — blocked, fixes to DEV1. Unit 1 -> fixing; booting DEV1 on the fix cycle. REV1 also filed upstream engine issue comment (#256, map-sql).
[19:06] Re-review round 2 on #100: SC-017/018/020/021 verified fixed; SC-016 Major residue (File.Exists false on IO error, {} JSON), SC-019 envelope validation, new SC-022 corrupt-install-id repair race. Unit 1 -> fixing round 2; booting DEV1.
[19:14] FnB deferred VM testing (RAM constraint, will run manually) — VM ruled off-limits for sprint 6; task rows to DEV1/DEV2/REV1; board updated. Verification bar for the sprint: unit tests + CI + headless UI suite.
[19:19] Round 3: review-clean on #100 @ 485abb4 — SC-016/019/022 closed, 0 Major/Medium, 1 Low (Windows ACL runtime verification rides deferred VM gate). Booting DEV1 to merge + unit report, then unit 2.
[19:21] Unit 1 MERGED @ acbfb40, unit report filed (msg #30): 5 ratified calls, 2 fix rounds, no deviations, VM follow-ups routed to FnB gate. Units 2 (DEV1) + 3 (DEV2) unblocked and tasked; booting both devs.
[19:32] Unit 3 pr-open: PR #101. Ratified DEV2''s 4 ambiguity calls (local-day bucketing, toggle-gap undercount, wall-clock union, plot-point timestamps). Awaiting checks.
[19:37] Unit 2 pr-open: PR #102. Ratified DEV1''s 4 collector ambiguity calls (DocumentId correlation, ApplicationInitialized session_start, toggle-independent maintenance, enable-time session semantics).
[19:40] Unit 3 review: 0 Major, 3 Medium (SC-023 identity fallback, SC-024 stale opening mispair, SC-025 Save-As transition) -> fixing; booting DEV2. REV1 live session proceeds to #102.
[19:44] Unit 2 review: 1 Major (SC-026 network IO in handlers) + 3 Medium (SC-027 mutable tracking key, SC-028 toggle race, SC-029 startup rollback) -> fixing; booting DEV1. REV1 session closed after both reviews.
[19:52] DEV2 pushed unit 3 fixes a8e9376 (259/259 local), session ended pre-CI; both PR watches route to PLN1 so green wakes me to boot DEV2 for re-request. Ratified its SC-025 mirror call (old identity ends at Save As).
[20:01] Unit 2 round 2: SC-026..029 fixed, 5bd4c1d green, re-review requested. Ratified CreationGUID throttle-key call. Unit 3 fixing SC-023 residual in parallel. Booting REV1 for #102 re-review.
[20:10] Unit 3 review-clean @ c1f8b33 (round 3). Tasking DEV2: merge #101 + report + start unit 4. Unit 2 fixing SC-030 (create() under _gate across Revit API calls).
[20:12] Unit 3 MERGED @ f77d6e5, report filed (msg #72): 5 ratified calls, 2 review rounds, no deviations. Unit 4 -> building (DEV2 same session). Remaining: unit 2 SC-030 fix, unit 4 build, unit 5 waits on 2+4.
[20:28] Unit 4 in-review: #103 green 6/6. Ratified 3 calls; session-block wiring pinned to unit 5 scope. Booting REV1 for #103.
[20:38] SC-032 spec defect ruled: WorksharingCentralGUID is Revit Server-only -> central_path added to match priority; spec 5 amended, decision #3 recorded. Unit 4 -> fixing (SC-031 + SC-032). Booting DEV2.
[20:46] Unit 2 MERGED as 1ea00c0, report filed (msg #97): 3 review rounds, 5 ratified calls, no deviations. 3/5 units on main. Unit 4 fix round live (SC-031+SC-032); unit 5 holds for it.
[20:53] SC-032 residual: keys-only events lacked central_path -> spec 5 keys-only capture set amended (join keys now include central_path). DEV2 fixing in #103 round 3.
[21:12] Unit 4 round 3 verdict: SC-032 null-handling residual (unknown IsModelInCloud defaulted non-cloud). Ruled: unknown suppresses central_path. Round 4 = wedge threshold; DEV2 told to stop-and-report if more surfaces.
[21:25] Unit 4 MERGED @ 73b5256, report filed (msg #121): 4 ratified calls, 4 review rounds on SC-031/032, no deviations. Unit 5 (last) tasked to DEV1: consent + session-block wiring.
[22:17] ALL 5 UNITS MERGED (unit 5 d09a7d0, report filed). Conformance pass tasked to REV1 pre-freeze; superseded queued integration run cancelled (runner offline, VM deferred). Main build run in progress.
[22:28] Conformance doc 7 filed: spec conforms except SC-035 Medium silent deviation (CentralPath missing from JoinKey) + SC-036 Low (deferred VM gate). Ruled: fix unit 6 inserted pre-freeze, DEV2 building; scoped conformance re-run after merge.
[23:18] Unit 6 round 3: SC-037 closed, SC-038 new (ambiguous lower-key close retires wrong doc). Ruled: general decline-on-ambiguity close rule for round 4, hard stop after. Judgement logged.
[23:41] Unit 6 round 4 verdict: SC-039 — exact lower-key hits bypass guard when sibling opened gapped. Ruled round 5 as ruling-completion (lineage-sibling overlap = ambiguity), FINAL cycle before FnB re-scope.
[03:15] Unit 6 MERGED @ 0042496 after 5 review rounds (SC-035/037/038/039 + lineage fallback); decline-on-ambiguity rule landed. Scoped conformance re-run tasked to REV1. DEV2 reported map gap to CART1 (#160) — flag to FnB: cartographer boot needed.
[03:35] FnB ruled SC-040 fix-now. Unit 7 dispatched to DEV2: count open docs not distinct keys in the decline guard.
[04:17] Unit 7 round 2: SC-041 closed, SC-042 (shortcut-vs-resolver precedence) — mechanical, in fix-now scope. Cycling DEV2 round 3. Report note: SC-040..042 = implementation-precision tail of one fix; aggregator correlation is a property-test candidate (Spec Debt).
[04:30] Unit 7 MERGED @ aba1034 (3 rounds: SC-040/041/042), report filed, no follow-ups. Final scoped conformance re-verify tasked to REV1 — last gate before freeze.
[04:37] Conformance re-verify: SC-040/042 as-specced; SC-043 remains (bucket-keyed interval survives rejecting sibling -> cross-project misattribution). Unit 8 dispatched under standing fix-now mandate: per-element matched occupancy.
[04:54] Unit 8 MERGED @ 3c8da29, 1-round clean, report filed. Final scoped conformance re-verify tasked; on clean verdict -> freeze + report.
[05:01] SPRINT 6 CLOSED 2026-07-19: conformance clean (doc 7 final 0/0/1-known-Low), doc 6 frozen (authority revoked), participants notified, watches all retired, report filed as doc 8 + shared/SPRINT_REPORT_telemetry-v1.md. Feature 2 stays in_progress pending FnB VM QA gate (SC-036).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
