INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (22, 3, 5, 'sprint 6: unit 1 re-review round 2 ready — PR #100 @ 485abb4, checks 6/6 green. SC-016: Read no longer keys first-run off File.Exists — only FileNotFound/DirectoryNotFound on the actual open read as first run; every other error fails closed, and valid JSON must carry an explicit boolean enabled (nullable-DTO read, so {} / missing-enabled / enabled:null fail closed). Tests incl. directory-at-path as the exists-but-inaccessible case. SC-019: TryParseLine now checks required-key presence on the raw JSON (initializers can''t backfill schema_version/source) + values: GUID event_id/session_guid, schema_version==1, source addin|recovery, nonblank event_type, seq>=1, parseable ts; per-key removal tests plus recovery negative (schema_version-less session_end gets re-closed for real) and prune negatives. SC-022: corrupt-id repair serialized via exclusive ReadWrite/FileShare.None handle — losers retry and re-read under their own lock, so all callers return the persisted id; 8-thread barrier test asserts all returns and file content agree (stable across 8 local runs).', '2026-07-18 19:14:28', '2026-07-18 19:19:29', 'shell', '4288168137c149748ebf316a7d04a158');
