INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (72, 4, 1, 'unit-report 6 unit=3 pr=#101
shipped: Activity aggregator in RST.Core/Telemetry — per-day open-hours series (tz-injectable day bucketing, interval-union across concurrent sessions), doc-load and sync event series, and current-file matching over closed outbox files; synthetic-outbox test suite (260 local, 6/6 CI checks green). Merged to main at f77d6e5.
