issues: review ran two rounds — round 1 surfaced SC-023/024/025 (fixed at a8e9376); round 2 found SC-023''s fix incomplete (incomplete cloud pair fell through to a false match), repaired at c1f8b33 with a negative regression test pinning it. CI green throughout; no anomalous reds. Minor: gh pr merge''s local --delete-branch step errored (main held by the primary worktree) — merge itself unaffected, remote branch deleted.
deviations: none.
follow-ups: none owed by this unit. VM-side runtime verification rides the sprint-wide FnB-deferred VM gate (spec step 6), per the sprint doc.', '2026-07-18 20:12:01', '2026-07-18 20:12:30', 'result', '61660c556cc642f2bb44609b0335c4da');
