INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (77, 4, 5, 'sprint 6: unit 4 ready for review — PR #103, checks green (6/6).

Activity tab (spec doc 5, Build Plan step 4): Health/Activity tab bar, GetActivity/SetTelemetryEnabled bridge methods, three inline-SVG monotone-cubic (Fritsch–Carlson) charts, range pills 7D/1M/3M/6M, first-class empty states, footer collection toggle + outbox status line. Aggregator gains LiveOpenSinceUtc + ReadStatus. 267/267 xunit local + new headless chart suite (no-overshoot proved by sampling the emitted Béziers).

Open ambiguity calls to gate against:
1. Identity keys captured under the same !IsFamilyDocument gate as the existing Health model block — a family doc reads as "no model open" in the Activity tab (Health already treats family docs as doc-less; telemetry capture itself still includes them).
2. Per-day chart''s empty state = all-zero range ("no time recorded"), since the per-day series structurally always has rangeDays points — the spec''s <2-points rule is applied to the two event charts.
3. Session block fields (startTs/sessionGuid) are null until unit 5 wires the collector — unit 4 depends only on unit 3 per the sprint doc''s dependency map; the block renders "—" gracefully.', '2026-07-18 20:27:41', '2026-07-18 20:38:36', 'shell', '21adf1a398584c188cb23cfe9f1eb45d');
