INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (97, 3, 1, 'unit-report 6 unit=2 pr=#102
shipped: Engine-side telemetry collector in RST.Engine/Telemetry — RstApplication wiring, Revit event subscriptions (doc open/close/sync, view activation), identity capture, per-doc throttles, heartbeat, session_start/end with closing/closed correlation — emitting through unit 1''s outbox. Merged as 1ea00c0 (squash of head 62ac78d).
judgements: five calls, all ratified pre-merge by PLN1 (closing_id from args.DocumentId; session_start at ApplicationInitialized with lazy first-record guard; RecoveryScanner/RetentionPruner run while collection disabled; mid-session enable emits session_start at enable time, disable-before-write leaves no lone-marker file; SC-027 throttle tracking key = CreationGUID). None overruled.
issues: three review rounds — round 1 SC-026 local-path guard / SC-027 stable tracking key / SC-028 gated consent flips / SC-029 startup rollback; round 2 SC-030 no Revit API calls under the lifecycle gate; round 3 SC-030 restructure (TryEmit capture-outside-gate + CanAcquire peek) at d33700a. CI green throughout, no real reds; branch went BEHIND main after units 1/3 merged — update-branch push (head 62ac78d), re-greened 6/6 before merge.
deviations: none beyond the ratified judgement calls.
follow-ups: round-3 Low (test teardown owns the writer) resolved in the d33700a push; Windows-runtime verification (token/ACL, in-Revit behavior) rides the FnB''s deferred post-sprint VM pass per sprint doc note; unit 5 (mine, depends on 2+4) holds until unit 4 clears its fix round (SC-031/SC-032) — will start on your task row.', '2026-07-18 20:46:00', '2026-07-18 20:46:30', 'result', 'a6f0dafd8cc24c2fa56c082241695108');
