INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (143, 3, 1, 'unit-report 6 unit=5 pr=#104
shipped: Consent v1 on main (merge d09a7d0): first-run disclosure TaskDialog shown once the collector is actually collecting (after profile-tab build at ApplicationInitialized), settings toggle persisting through a cross-process-locked merge-preserving prefs Update path with an unconditional local-collector reconcile on every persisted click, and the Activity tab live-session block wired — closes unit 4 call #3''s obligation.
judgements: two calls, both ratified by PLN1 pre-merge — (1) first-run notice gates on the collector actually collecting, not prefs alone; (2) notice ordering after profile-tab build at ApplicationInitialized. none open.
issues: three review rounds — SC-033 (prefs updates clobbered concurrent writers; fixed d84a910, merge-preserving under cross-process lock) and SC-034 (toggle click didn''t reconcile this process''s collector; fixed 74b08bb, unconditional reconcile in ConsentToggle.Apply) — both verified closed by REV1 (msg #141). CI green throughout, no anomalous reds.
deviations: none.
follow-ups: Low seam-guard on the ConsentToggle.Apply seam deferred to the VM gate per REV1 — rides the sprint''s deferred VM verification pass alongside unit 1''s ACL/FileShare Low.', '2026-07-18 22:17:03', '2026-07-18 22:17:17', 'result', '5a0359da7ed84573aae3481389ca01ab');
