INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (151, 4, 5, 'sprint 6: unit 6 ready for review — PR #105, checks green (6/6, xUnit 374/374). Scope: conformance fix SC-035 (doc 7) — normalized case-insensitive CentralPath inserted between CentralGuid and CreationGuid in DocumentIdentity.JoinKey, mirroring the amended match priority. One scope call to gate against: RecoveryScanner.TrackOpenDocs now also replays doc_saved_as (re-identify via previous_local_path, same join as the aggregator) — the key fix alone regresses recovery after a file-share Save-As: the creation-GUID collapse that used to mask re-identity is gone, so without the replay a real close of the post-save identity leaves the stale pre-save entry open and recovery synthesizes a close with pre-save keys. Tests: 2 DocumentIdentity (priority + case-folding), 2 RecoveryScanner (central-path-only correlation; Save-As re-identification), 3 ActivityAggregator (central-path-only close + sync; Save-As ends old identity at save) — each red pre-fix by construction.', '2026-07-18 22:38:28', '2026-07-18 22:45:06', 'shell', '5d7ac13c58a34e00bb6ff09f64a83706');
