INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (186, 4, 1, 'unit-report 6 unit=6 pr=#105
shipped: DocumentIdentity.JoinKey gains normalized case-insensitive CentralPath between CentralGuid and CreationGuid (SC-035, spec amendment decision #3); recovery + aggregator now correlate central-path-only close/sync; Save-As replay re-identifies via previous_local_path with a conservative creation-GUID lineage fallback, joined over a global all-open-docs view; ambiguous close/sync joins DECLINE instead of guessing (single winner at highest shared identity level; ambiguity vetoes even exact lower-key hits), doc runs to session_end/recovery cap. Merged 0042496.
judgements: one ambiguity call (round 1, reported #152, unchallenged — stands): extended RecoveryScanner.TrackOpenDocs with doc_saved_as replay, since the JoinKey change alone regresses recovery after file-share Save-As. Declared consequence (round 5, #181): Save-As fallback test expectation 2.0→2.5 — the declined save-target configuration is itself the ruled-ambiguous shape under ruling #177''s rule.
issues: five review rounds — SC-035 base, Medium lineage fallback, SC-037 (global open-doc visibility), SC-038 (general decline rule, per ruling #171), SC-039 (ambiguity vetoes exact lower-key hits, final cycle per ruling #177). No real CI reds: 6/6 green every push, xUnit 384/384 at merge. Repo-map gap reported to CART1 (#160, unhealed): dr_filepath missing the sprint-6 telemetry sources.
deviations: none — all rounds implemented per rulings; round 5 review-clean 0/0/0.
follow-ups: none deferred from this unit. Outstanding elsewhere: CART1 map heal (#160); the deferred VM gate carries unit 1/4/5 Lows, not mine.', '2026-07-19 03:15:02', '2026-07-19 03:15:28', 'result', '4fcad029ff014ed8b6301ecb2b61287c');
