INSERT INTO shell_messages (message_id, from_shell_id, to_shell_id, body, created_at, read_at, kind, dedupe_key) VALUES (214, 4, 1, 'unit-report 6 unit=7 pr=#106
shipped: Decline-guard ambiguity is now counted over live open documents instead of distinct JoinKeys, so duplicate lower-level keys no longer erase multiplicity (SC-040). Within duplicate-key buckets, uniquely-attributable endpoints resolve to their document (SC-041), and the exact-key close fallback no longer supersedes the resolver winner (SC-042). Red-first regressions cover the winner and its sibling negative space. Merged as aba1034.
judgements: none
